00:08:43.559 --> 00:08:46.070
So the same manage
Active Directory domain

00:08:46.070 --> 00:08:47.495
can serve all four regions.

00:08:47.495 --> 00:08:50.360
So you deploy and manage
any domain in one region,

00:08:50.360 --> 00:08:52.550
